sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser
  participant K as second KDF worker
  participant S as server
  B->>B: change tapped, old name and passphrase kept in memory
  B->>K: re-derive the OLD key so it can still sign
  B->>B: derive NEW key from new name + passphrase
  Note over B,S: nothing is sent until Commit
  B->>S: rekey signed by OLD key (newpub, newname, ts)
  S->>S: old key matches the bound seat, ts newer, new name free
  S->>S: record moves to new key and name (slots, order, host role kept)
  B->>S: then pending settings, then the vote, each ts newer
  Note over B,S: before Commit the OLD key stays live for host actions
